                                "sense_id": "3d340a20-fb4b-330a-acd1-527e15545d6e",
                                "text": "The plainer, he was from the Marine police station on Anderson Street and Davin or Devine or something was his name — said nothing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6dd40ef3-1b9a-486e-83ed-1b9db434608e",
                                "sense_id": "3d340a20-fb4b-330a-acd1-527e15545d6e",
                                "text": "A guy and a girl make ideal plainers; nobody gives them a second thought; people just assume they're a couple."
